------------------------
The words Wordle accepts as guesses (src/assets/php/games/wordle/words/) come
from these dictionaries. The daily words are picked from them by hand.

English              ENABLE (Enhanced North American Benchmark Lexicon)
                     https://github.com/dolph/dictionary
                     Public domain. Its five-letter words.
